    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from broke to millionaire by building your factory empire from the ground up! Automate production by purchasing, upgrading, and planning the floor layout for your machinery and purchase multiple factory buildings to expand income potential for your company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize production lines by making sure your products make it out of the factory otherwise you lose money and deliver products for endless wealth and see how rich you can get!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go from broke to millionaire by building your factory empire from the ground up! Automate production by purchasing, upgrading, and planning the floor layout for your machinery and purchase multiple factory buildings to expand income potential for your company!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize production lines by making sure your products make it out of the factory otherwise you lose money and deliver products for endless wealth and see how rich you can get!</p>",
    "short_description": "The Factory is a first-person, factory sim game with machine purchasing, upgrading, and building expansion. Use income from crafted products to buy and upgrade tools and buildings. Upgrade your factory layout to gain infinite wealth while trying not to lose money from damaging products.",
